    "title": "Ole Miss freshman Bryden Bull to play in NCAA baseball tournament",
    "text": "Bryden Bull, a Las Vegas High School alum and current freshman for the Ole Miss Rebels baseball team, is set to take part in the NCAA Tournament.\nOle Miss enters as the No. 13 seed and will face the fifth-seeded North Carolina Tar Heels in their opening matchup.\nThe first round game is scheduled for Friday, June 12, at 6:10 p.m. at Charles Schwab Field Omaha.\nBryden Bull — Outfielder and first baseman — Freshman — 6′5″ — 200 — Hometown: Las Vegas",
